From 91f43116 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mjolnir contributors <mjolnir@worldtree.network>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add the ingest keyframe gate on the vendored pin

Policy stays off unless whip::Request enables it. When on, startup, step,
period, loss, and join share one floor and one PLI. Viewer keyframe
requests stay logged and dropped. A held cause is armed at the floor,
a line without PLI arms no timer, and join follows moq-net demand.

---
